            "id": 74249,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir for döngüsünün yapısını oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" () {}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Boş kod bloğunu üç kez tekrarla. <code>i</code> değerini <code>0</code>'dan başlat ve küçüktür karşılaştırması kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\"+\" /><text value=\"+\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i--\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>0</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>3</code> ve son olarak <code>i++</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
